  "body": "If you're looking for space, sunshine and a superb coastal location, this single-level, double glazed, brick and tile home, built in 2011,  ticks all the boxes.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned down a quiet right of way, this spacious and light-filled home offers comfortable, easy-care living with the added convenience of wheelchair-friendly access.\r\n\r\nFeaturing three generous bedrooms and two bathrooms, the well-designed layout centres around a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, flowing seamlessly outdoors to a covered patio and easy-care lawned gardens. It's the perfect setting for relaxed entertaining, family time or simply enjoying the sunshine.\r\n\r\nPracticality is key, with a double internal-access garage and plenty of additional off-street parking, ideal for visitors or those needing space for the boat or trailer.\r\n\r\nLocation is the real bonus. Enjoy an easy stroll to the heart of Manly Village, where you'll find local shops, cafes, restaurants and everyday amenities. The Peninsula's beautiful local beaches are just moments away.\r\n\r\nZoned for Whangaparaoa Primary and College, this is an appealing option for families, downsizers, investors, professionals or anyone seeking the convenience of single-level living in a fantastic coastal community.\r\nSunny, spacious and superbly located - this is Manly living made easy.\r\n\r\nCall us today to arrange your viewing!\r\n\r\nAuction: 4:00pm, Thursday 10 December 2026 In Rooms, Ray White Orewa (unless sold prior). You can watch the auction live here: https://rwcarpenterrealty.co.nz/watch-our-auctions-live",
